WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.013
[girl] Where are we?

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:16.641
[boy] I think we're near Shadow Basin,
but where is it?

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.227
[instruments beeping]

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.813
There's no base. It's gone.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.565
Where do we go?

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.233
[alarm blaring]

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:27.360
[Root] Category III&nbsp;Kaiju on approach.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.284
[Ford] Everyone out!

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.536
-Take cover in the rocks!
-[passengers panting]

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:39.539
Go. Go. Go!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.876
Mommy! Daddy! Look out!

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:47.630
[people screaming]

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.477
[gun sputtering]

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.395
-[alarm blaring]
-Brina!

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.272
I know. I know!

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:05.899
[grunts]

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.734
[screeches]

00:01:08.943 --> 00:01:09.819
[Brina grunts]

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:16.618
[both panting]

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.411
-Nice work.
-Thanks.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:19.996
Ready a warhead.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.289
-[Root] Armed.
-Fire.

00:01:42.685 --> 00:01:44.896
[boom resonating]

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:47.816
[air whooshes]

